## Safety and operations

- Never commit real secret values. Document variable names in `.env.example`.
- Do not run destructive migrations or production commands without explicit
  authority and a verified target.
- Do not create new documentation unless requested or needed to correct
  documentation made inaccurate by the change.

## Definition of done

- requested behaviour is implemented
- relevant local tests and lint pass
- user changes and unrelated files remain intact
- errors, compatibility changes and incomplete verification are reported
